{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1448814-hollow-trod-ideas","id":1448814,"title":"Hollow & Trod Ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-17T16:21:36-07:00","id":1448814,"title":"Hollow & Trod Ideas","content":"Write out some of your cooler Hollow &amp; Trod Ideas!<br /> <br /> <b>Ice Street</b><br /> A single street of broken buildings covered with ice and snow. The entire street is so cold you'll suffer frostbite without protection (think Antartica) and is said to be this way due to a curse - whether on a person, the location or an item. The Wailing Woman moves through Ice Street and someone wonder whether she is a cursed changeling, a Banished or something else, for few have faced her and survived. Some say her diary lies frozen on the streets and any who read it might well learn more of her fate.<br /> <br /> <b>Cross Highway</b><br /> A major trod that changes where it sits and is typically avoided by changelings because it is often used by the Keepers. It's said that if you follow it with a clear image in your head, you can find wherever you want to go. The downside is that this particular quality really does make it commonly used by the gentry.<br /> <br /> <b>The Grand Mushroom</b><br /> A tall mushroom within which sits a fanciful Hollow. If you attempt to enter without an invitation, the mushroom's spores will put you to sleep and you will eventually die and become its breakfast.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My horror roleplaying blog with a strong focus on World of Darkness and Call of Cthulhu can be found here: <a href=\"http://stwildonroleplaying.blogspot.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\">http://stwildonroleplaying.blogspot.com.au/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1248-laraqua","name":"Laraqua","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}